[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - **B is not perturbed**, so B remains at its original value (which is 0).  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - B is not a cause of any node in the graph, so B does not influence any other node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - A, D are not descendants of B (since B has no outgoing edges).  
