[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m So for `Perturb(D)`, the output is consistent.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m Now, re-evaluate `Perturb(C)`:
