[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - C is the source, so D is a descendant (C->D), so D:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - A is not a descendant of C, so A:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - B is not a descendant of C, so B:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - C is the perturbed node, so C:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - Therefore, the expected output is: `A:1, B:0, C:0, D:1`.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m 
