[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - So perturbing C would mean C is 0, and A, B, D are 0 (since they are not reachable from C).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - This matches the observed result: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0. ✅
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m 
