[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m #### For **Perturb(D)**:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - A is 0 (as required).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - B is 0 (no effect), as it is not a downstream of D (D->C, but B is not a downstream of D).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - C is downstream of D (D->C), so C is 1.
