[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - C:0: C is not a downstream of A or B (since C causes A and B, but A and B are not downstream of C in this graph; C is upstream of A and B in the graph)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=682122)[0m - D:1: D is a downstream of A or B. Since A->D and B->D, D is a downstream of both A and B, so D is 1.
